  {"stt":11,"muc":"8.2","dang":"T107010404","loai":"tu_luan","nd":"Tìm x biết: $\\left(x + \\dfrac{5}{4}\\right)^2 = \\dfrac{9}{4}$",
   "lg":"$\\left(x + \\dfrac{5}{4}\\right)^2 = \\left(\\dfrac{3}{2}\\right)^2$\nTH1: $x + \\dfrac{5}{4} = \\dfrac{3}{2}$\n$x = \\dfrac{6}{4} - \\dfrac{5}{4} = \\dfrac{1}{4}$\nTH2: $x + \\dfrac{5}{4} = \\dfrac{-3}{2}$\n$x = \\dfrac{-6}{4} - \\dfrac{5}{4} = \\dfrac{-11}{4}$\nVậy $x \\in \\left\\{\\dfrac{1}{4}; \\dfrac{-11}{4}\\right\\}$"},
  {"stt":12,"muc":"8.2","dang":"T107010404","loai":"tu_luan","nd":"Tìm x biết: $\\left(2x - \\dfrac{1}{3}\\right)^3 = \\dfrac{1}{8}$",
   "lg":"$\\left(2x - \\dfrac{1}{3}\\right)^3 = \\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)^3$\n$2x - \\dfrac{1}{3} = \\dfrac{1}{2}$\n$2x = \\dfrac{3}{6} + \\dfrac{2}{6} = \\dfrac{5}{6}$\n$x = \\dfrac{5}{12}$"},
  {"stt":13,"muc":"8.2","dang":"T107010404","loai":"tu_luan","nd":"Tìm x biết: $2 - \\left(x - \\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)^2 = \\dfrac{2}{9}$",
   "lg":"$2 - \\left(x - \\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)^2 = \\dfrac{2}{9}$\n$\\left(x - \\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)^2 = 2 - \\dfrac{2}{9} = \\dfrac{16}{9} = \\left(\\dfrac{4}{3}\\right)^2$\nTH1: $x - \\dfrac{1}{2} = \\dfrac{4}{3}$\n$x = \\dfrac{8}{6} + \\dfrac{3}{6} = \\dfrac{11}{6}$\nTH2: $x - \\dfrac{1}{2} = \\dfrac{-4}{3}$\n$x = \\dfrac{-8}{6} + \\dfrac{3}{6} = \\dfrac{-5}{6}$\nVậy $x \\in \\left\\{\\dfrac{11}{6}; \\dfrac{-5}{6}\\right\\}$"},
  {"stt":14,"muc":"8.2","dang":"T107010404","loai":"tu_luan","nd":"Tìm x biết: $4 - \\left(x - \\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)^2 = \\dfrac{19}{25}$",
   "lg":"$4 - \\left(x - \\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)^2 = \\dfrac{19}{25}$\n$\\left(x - \\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)^2 = 4 - \\dfrac{19}{25} = \\dfrac{81}{25} = \\left(\\dfrac{9}{5}\\right)^2$\nTH1: $x - \\dfrac{1}{2} = \\dfrac{9}{5}$\n$x = \\dfrac{18}{10} + \\dfrac{5}{10} = \\dfrac{23}{10}$\nTH2: $x - \\dfrac{1}{2} = \\dfrac{-9}{5}$\n$x = \\dfrac{-18}{10} + \\dfrac{5}{10} = \\dfrac{-13}{10}$\nVậy $x \\in \\left\\{\\dfrac{23}{10}; \\dfrac{-13}{10}\\right\\}$"},
  {"stt":15,"muc":"8.2","dang":"T107010404","loai":"tu_luan","nd":"Tìm x biết: $\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2} - x\\right)^2 = \\dfrac{9}{16}$",
   "lg":"$\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2} - x\\right)^2 = \\left(\\dfrac{3}{4}\\right)^2$\nTH1: $\\dfrac{1}{2} - x = \\dfrac{3}{4}$\n$x = \\dfrac{2}{4} - \\dfrac{3}{4} = \\dfrac{-1}{4}$\nTH2: $\\dfrac{1}{2} - x = \\dfrac{-3}{4}$\n$x = \\dfrac{2}{4} + \\dfrac{3}{4} = \\dfrac{5}{4}$\nVậy $x \\in \\left\\{\\dfrac{-1}{4}; \\dfrac{5}{4}\\right\\}$"},
