  {"stt":17,"muc":"8.3","dang":"T107010405","loai":"tu_luan","nd":"Tìm x biết: $\\left(x - \\dfrac{2}{7}\\right)\\left(2x + \\dfrac{3}{4}\\right) = 0$","da":"$\\dfrac{2}{7}; -\\dfrac{3}{8}$",
   "lg":"$\\left(x - \\dfrac{2}{7}\\right)\\left(2x + \\dfrac{3}{4}\\right) = 0$\nTH1: $x - \\dfrac{2}{7} = 0$ suy ra $x = \\dfrac{2}{7}$\nTH2: $2x + \\dfrac{3}{4} = 0$ suy ra $2x = \\dfrac{-3}{4}$, $x = \\dfrac{-3}{8}$\nVậy $x \\in \\left\\{\\dfrac{2}{7}; \\dfrac{-3}{8}\\right\\}$"},
  {"stt":18,"muc":"8.3","dang":"T107010405","loai":"tu_luan","nd":"Tìm x biết: $\\left(\\dfrac{1}{4}x - \\dfrac{2}{5}\\right)\\left(\\dfrac{2}{7}x + \\dfrac{3}{4}\\right) = 0$","da":"$\\dfrac{8}{5}; -\\dfrac{21}{8}$",
   "lg":"$\\left(\\dfrac{1}{4}x - \\dfrac{2}{5}\\right)\\left(\\dfrac{2}{7}x + \\dfrac{3}{4}\\right) = 0$\nTH1: $\\dfrac{1}{4}x - \\dfrac{2}{5} = 0$ suy ra $\\dfrac{1}{4}x = \\dfrac{2}{5}$, $x = \\dfrac{8}{5}$\nTH2: $\\dfrac{2}{7}x + \\dfrac{3}{4} = 0$ suy ra $\\dfrac{2}{7}x = \\dfrac{-3}{4}$, $x = \\dfrac{-3}{4} \\cdot \\dfrac{7}{2} = \\dfrac{-21}{8}$\nVậy $x \\in \\left\\{\\dfrac{8}{5}; \\dfrac{-21}{8}\\right\\}$"},
  {"stt":19,"muc":"8.3","dang":"T107010405","loai":"tu_luan","nd":"Tìm x biết: $\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}x - \\dfrac{2}{5}\\right)\\left(\\dfrac{1}{3}x + \\dfrac{3}{5}\\right) = 0$","da":"$\\dfrac{4}{5}; -\\dfrac{9}{5}$",
   "lg":"$\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}x - \\dfrac{2}{5}\\right)\\left(\\dfrac{1}{3}x + \\dfrac{3}{5}\\right) = 0$\nTH1: $\\dfrac{1}{2}x - \\dfrac{2}{5} = 0$ suy ra $\\dfrac{1}{2}x = \\dfrac{2}{5}$, $x = \\dfrac{4}{5}$\nTH2: $\\dfrac{1}{3}x + \\dfrac{3}{5} = 0$ suy ra $\\dfrac{1}{3}x = \\dfrac{-3}{5}$, $x = \\dfrac{-9}{5}$\nVậy $x \\in \\left\\{\\dfrac{4}{5}; \\dfrac{-9}{5}\\right\\}$"},
