  {"stt":21,"muc":"8.4","dang":"T107010406","loai":"tu_luan","nd":"Tìm x biết: $3^{2x} - 2 \\cdot 3^5 = 3^5$","da":"$3$",
   "lg":"$3^{2x} - 2 \\cdot 3^5 = 3^5$\n$3^{2x} = 3^5 + 2 \\cdot 3^5 = 3 \\cdot 3^5$\n$3^{2x} = 3^6$\n$2x = 6$\n$x = 3$"},
  {"stt":22,"muc":"8.4","dang":"T107010406","loai":"tu_luan","nd":"Tìm x biết: $8^{x+3} + 2^{3x} - 2^9 = 2^{18}$","da":"$3$",
   "lg":"$8^{x+3} = \\left(2^3\\right)^{x+3} = 2^{3x+9} = 2^{3x} \\cdot 2^9$\n$2^{3x} \\cdot 2^9 + 2^{3x} = 2^{18} + 2^9$\n$2^{3x} \\cdot \\left(2^9 + 1\\right) = 2^9 \\cdot \\left(2^9 + 1\\right)$\n$2^{3x} = 2^9$\n$3x = 9$\n$x = 3$"},
  {"stt":23,"muc":"8.4","dang":"T107010406","loai":"tu_luan","nd":"Tìm x biết: $5^{x+1} - 5^x = 100$","da":"$2$",
   "lg":"$5^{x+1} - 5^x = 100$\n$5^x \\cdot (5 - 1) = 100$\n$5^x \\cdot 4 = 100$\n$5^x = 25 = 5^2$\n$x = 2$"},
  {"stt":24,"muc":"8.4","dang":"T107010406","loai":"tu_luan","nd":"Tìm x biết: $3^{x+1} - 3^x = 54$","da":"$3$",
   "lg":"$3^{x+1} - 3^x = 54$\n$3^x \\cdot (3 - 1) = 54$\n$3^x \\cdot 2 = 54$\n$3^x = 27 = 3^3$\n$x = 3$"},
